 brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R2RVAWTJF9ZNQP_1_review_text" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="peekExpand"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized" data-a-max-height="300" style="max-height:300px"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-CA" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>Literally the best mouse I&#x27;ve ever owned. Been using it for 7 months. The software is excellent. I&#x27;m able to run it with 6 profiles (or more if I wanted to)—12+ shortcuts each—that could output a single key, a combination of keys, a macro, a string of letters or numbers like an email or password—or even a sentence. I can move between profiles like pages with the press of any button I configure. Plus, the hypershift button is elite. It gives me access to another set of configurable shortcuts &quot;hidden&quot; behind each of those 6 profiles and accessible by holding down that hypershift button, so I effectively have 24+ shortcuts for each profile. I basically never have to use my keyboard unless I&#x27;m typing (and even then, there&#x27;s always the on-screen keyboard) or gaming.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>At first, it was easy to accidentally press the buttons when lifting the mouse to reposition it for gaming/navigating, but I just had to let my hand develop the muscle memory over a week or so to be able to reposition it without accidental mashing—and I&#x27;m glad I did because this mouse has been a game changer. I don&#x27;t think I&#x27;ll ever purchase another mouse without the same capabilities. A USB-C rechargeable 4000+ mWh AA battery from Temu lasts a solid month. Buttons are perfectly responsive. Being able to switch between smooth and step-scrolling is awesome, and the mouse fits snugly in the hand. Easily a 5-star mouse. Totally worth the price, and even more worth it if it&#x27;s on sale. Superiorly more capable than every alternative.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon"></i></span><span class="a-see-more a-color-link"><span class="a-see-more-text" style="display:none">Read more</span><span class="a-see-less-text" style="display:none">Read less</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="translationSpinner" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner-container_ypxf2"><div class="a-spinner-wrapper _Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner_1tBUJ"><span class="a-spinner a-spinner-medium"></span></div></div></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-top-small _Y3Itd_helpful-votes-container_3iphI"><span data-hook="helpful-vote-statement" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">2 people found this helpful</span></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-small a-spacing-top-small"><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-vote-action-bar_10AyR"><div data-hook="helpfulVoteWidget" class="a-section a-spacing-none _Y3Itd_cr-voting-section_1cNTp"><div class="_Y3Itd_cr-helpful-button_1u3UK cr-vote-component" data-hook="helpfulVoteButton" data-mix-operations="HelpfulVoteClickHandler" data-asin="B0BGJT87N2" data-id="R2RVAWTJF9ZNQP" data-return-to="DpReview" data-csa-c-type="element" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R2RVAWTJF9ZNQP_1_helpful_button"><span class="a-button a-button-base"><span class="a-button-inner"><input type="submit" class="a-button-input"/><span class="a-button-text" aria-hidden="true"><div class="_Y3Itd_cr-helpful-text-desktop_2dXQG">Helpful</div></span></sp