title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="en-CA">It’s great, love the customization</h5></a><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">Reviewed in Canada on December 27, 2022</span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a data-hook="format-strip" class="a-link-normal" href="/portal/customer-reviews/B0BGJT87N2/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_fmt?_encoding=UTF8&amp;formatType=current_format"><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Size: Naga V2 HyperSpeed</span></a><i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i><span class="_Y3Itd_inline-contributor_33jDb"><div data-hook="review-badges"><a class="a-link-normal" href="/gp/help/customer/display.html/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_avp?ie=UTF8&amp;nodeId=G8UYX7LALQC8V9KA"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></a></div></span></div><div data-hook="reviewTextContainer" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM"><div data-hook="reviewText" class="a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R2NM7O327LQSW_4_review_text" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="peekExpand"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized" data-a-max-height="300" style="max-height:300px"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-CA" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>Review is for Razer Naga V2 Hyperspeed, not V2 Pro.</span></p><p><span>I don’t understand most of the other reviews. If the software sucks, just assign the keys once and don’t use it until you need to re-assign the keys. To the guy that said one scroll forward, two scrolls back, maybe don’t use hyperscroll if you’re not comfortable?? lol</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>Took me a week to get used to this mouse(I have only used regular mice before this), and about 2 more weeks to build muscle memory for using 12 buttons. The mouse is great, I have no complaints.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>Buy from Amazon (not a third party seller) instead of Razer website, so you don’t have to deal with Razer’s crappy customer support.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>I also see mentions of issues with unintentional clicking, don’t buy sensitive mice if your hands are not used to them, or learn to rest your hand on the mouse instead of squeezing it.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>When you plug the mouse into a computer, it will automatically download the software. After the installation is complete, you might want to disable it at startup from the task manager. You might have to look up how to assign keys if you’re doing it for the first time, but after you’ve done it once it’s easy. You can set up multiple profiles for different games/softwares, but you will have to switch them using the Razer software.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>I have been using this mouse for about a month and have not experienced any issues. I will update this review if I do.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon"></i></spa