cle memory for using 12 buttons. The mouse is great, I have no complaints.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>Buy from Amazon (not a third party seller) instead of Razer website, so you don’t have to deal with Razer’s crappy customer support.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>I also see mentions of issues with unintentional clicking, don’t buy sensitive mice if your hands are not used to them, or learn to rest your hand on the mouse instead of squeezing it.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>When you plug the mouse into a computer, it will automatically download the software. After the installation is complete, you might want to disable it at startup from the task manager. You might have to look up how to assign keys if you’re doing it for the first time, but after you’ve done it once it’s easy. You can set up multiple profiles for different games/softwares, but you will have to switch them using the Razer software.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>I have been using this mouse for about a month and have not experienced any issues. I will update this review if I do.</span></p><ul class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-thumbnail-image-container_2nWBS" data-reviewbind="MediaThumbnailsBlock"><li class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-list-item-style_d1lj6" data-reviewbind="MediaThumbnail"><button data-mediaid="51sqxXcftvL" data-reviewid="R2NM7O327LQSW" data-thumbidx="0" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-thumbnail-image-button_2LRc_" data-mix-operations="thumbnailClickHandler" aria-pressed="false"><img alt="" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sqxXcftvL.jpg" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-thumbnail-image-view_2J_oP" height="80" width="80"/></button></li><li class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-list-item-style_d1lj6" data-reviewbind="MediaThumbnail"><button data-mediaid="61w-wBzGCYL" data-reviewid="R2NM7O327LQSW" data-thumbidx="1" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-thumbnail-image-button_2LRc_" data-mix-operations="thumbnailClickHandler" aria-pressed="false"><img alt="" src="https://m.media-