ew-star-rating-bar-desktop_1T97A"><i data-hook="review-star-rating" class="a-icon a-icon-star a-star-3"><span class="a-icon-alt">3 out of 5 stars</span></i><span class="a-letter-space"></span></div><a class="a-size-base a-color-base a-link-normal a-text-bold" href="/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2SU4AONMJM8AK/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&amp;ie=UTF8"><h5 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="en-CA">Good quality but be ready for hunt for the right thumb button</h5></a><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">Reviewed in Canada on February 14, 2026</span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a data-hook="format-strip" class="a-link-normal" href="/portal/customer-reviews/B0BGJT87N2/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_fmt?_encoding=UTF8&amp;formatType=current_format"><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Size: Naga V2 HyperSpeed</span></a><i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i><span class="_Y3Itd_inline-contributor_33jDb"><div data-hook="review-badges"><a class="a-link-normal" href="/gp/help/customer/display.html/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_avp?ie=UTF8&amp;nodeId=G8UYX7LALQC8V9KA"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></a></div></span></div><div data-hook="reviewTextContainer" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM"><div data-hook="reviewText" class="a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R2SU4AONMJM8AK_5_review_text" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="peekExpand"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized" data-a-max-height="300" style="max-height:300px"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-CA" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>Does it work and have every feature that one would want out of mmo mouse.....yes.</span></p><p><span>Then why did I return it..........ergonomics are pretty bad for me. So bad that my hand actually hurts after 5 minutes of use.</span></p><p><span>If you ever used a logitech mouse like MX revolution/master or g502 then chances of you liking this mouse will be slimmer specially if this is only your side mouse.</span></p><p><span>Reasons why I hate it:</span></p><p><span>1- thumb buttons are small and practically indistinguishable. One can argue that you need to practice to get used to it but at my age, going to shaolin temple is not an option. Your thumb will keep seeking for the buttons like the USB stick that is lost in drawer all those things that you never find when you need them.</span></p><p><span>2- Shape of mouse is awkward for me. The way i have to grip the mouse is that my fingers are stretched out. mouse is smaller than logitech g502 but still is harder to use and was giving my wrist a hard time. I finally figured out why. The front of the mouse is lower than g502. I wished i could add the pictures but unfortunately i have already returned the mouse. Anyways.........the left and right click button are on lower position than the palm itself (check the sideview at the product page). And therefore your fingers are stretched. so if you are a palmer of the mouse or like to rest your arm on the table when using the mouse then you are bound to have problems.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>I used first razer mouse about 14 years ago.......and 14 years later I have the same complaints. The build quality is good. And since ergonomics is a subjective thing, I cannt complain much and size of the buttons can also be forgiven but indistinguishable buttons is a sin.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>The only thing in this mouse that you wont find in others is free wheel and wheel side clicks.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon"></i></span><span class="a-see-more a-color-link"><span class="a-see-more-text" style="display:none">Read more</span><span class="a-see-less-text" style="display:none">Read less</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="translationSpinner" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner-container_ypxf2"><div class="a-spinner-wrapper _Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner_1tBUJ"><span class="a-spinner a-spinner-medium"></span></div></div></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-top-small _Y3Itd_helpful-votes-container_3iphI"><span data-hook="helpful-vote-statement" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">7 people found this helpful</span></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-small a-spacing-top-small"><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-vote-action-bar_10AyR"><div data-hook="helpfulVoteWidget" class="a-section a-spacing-none _Y3Itd_cr-voting-section_1cNTp"><div class="_Y3Itd_cr-helpful-button_1u3UK cr-vote-component" data-hook="helpfulVoteButton" data-mix-operations="HelpfulVoteClickHandler" data-asin="B0BGJT87N2" data-id="R2SU4AONMJM8AK" data-return-to="DpReview" data-csa-c-type="element" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R2SU4AONMJM8AK_5_helpful_button"><span class="a-button a-button-base"><span class="a-button-inner"><inpu