tps://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"/></noscript></div></div><div class="a-profile-content"><span class="a-profile-name">Danielle Gaudet</span></div></a></div><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-star-rating-bar-desktop_1T97A"><i data-hook="review-star-rating" class="a-icon a-icon-star a-star-4"><span class="a-icon-alt">4 out of 5 stars</span></i><span class="a-letter-space"></span></div><a class="a-size-base a-color-base a-link-normal a-text-bold" href="/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R23BIES590LOFQ/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&amp;ie=UTF8"><h5 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="en-CA">Lovely shelf, wonky instructions and missing screw</h5></a><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">Reviewed in Canada on April 29, 2024</span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a data-hook="format-strip" class="a-link-normal" href="/portal/customer-reviews/B0BWDNXK3Q/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_fmt?_encoding=UTF8&amp;formatType=current_format"><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Size: 140cm<i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i></span><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Colour Name: Walnut</span></a><i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i><span class="_Y3Itd_inline-contributor_33jDb"><div data-hook="review-badges"><a class="a-link-normal" href="/gp/help/customer/display.html/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_avp?ie=UTF8&amp;nodeId=G8UYX7LALQC8V9KA"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></a></div></span></div><div data-hook="reviewTextContainer" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM"><div data-hook="reviewText" class="a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R23BIES590LOFQ_3_review_text" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="peekExpand"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized" data-a-max-height="300" style="max-height:300px"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-CA" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>It was tricky to put together because the instructions graphics were too busy to be able to see exactly what went where. It would have been great to have a paper template for the back hole placement (so masking tape to mark out is the next best option).</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>We were missing a screw for the handle, and there’s no option to connect with the seller directly to request a missing part. Amazon offered me $5 via a balance to my account, but this somewhat doesn’t make up for me now needing to make a trip to a hardware store to find a singular screw (or, a new handle entirely if I can’t find the correct screw - not the end of the world, the handle is cheap).</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>Having said that, the shelf itself is lovely and sturdy. The centre fold-down door is an odd colour choice and the handle isn’t aesthetically pleasing.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>In other words, mostly good but some improvements to be made.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click"><a href=