eans so well- I don’t have to pre wash the dishes like my older model which was a whirlpool. It has so many cool settings and a delay even for me when I approach my time of use demand rate which I tried to avoid to save money on my electric bill.\r\nThis model has a trap to collect debris that can plug up \r\nThe drain and it lets everything do its correct job inside the washer! Such a beautiful design as well! Fits beautifully into my kitchen! Thank you Frigidaire for making a wonderful product! When my refrigerator goes I will look at your products first indeed! ❤️"}]}</script><script type="application/ld+json" id="breadcrumb-json-ld" data-rh="true">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"item":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"/en-CA","name":"Home"}}],[{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"item":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"en-CA/category/appliances/26517","name":"Appliances"}}],[{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"item":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"en-CA/category/major-appliances/11962778","name":"Major Appliances"}}],[{"@type":"ListItem","position":4,"item":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"en-CA/category/dishwashers/34432","name":"Dishwashers"}}],[{"@type":"ListItem","position":5,"item":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"en-CA/category/built-in-dishwashers/12004360","name":"Built-In Dishwashers"}}],[{"@type":"ListItem","position":6,"item":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":null,"name":"Product Details"}}]]}</script><script type="text/javascript" src="https://assets.queue-it.net/bestbuycanada/integrationconfig/javascript/queueclientConfig.js?versionTimestamp=20261010212106"></script><link rel="preconnect" href="https://api.bazaarvoice.com/" crossorigin="anonymous"><script src="https://assets.adobedtm.com/extensions/EPbf7b42aa08bc4f10879b1484195e80d1/AppMeasurement.min.js" async=""></script><script src="https://assets.adobedtm.com/extensions/EPbf7b42aa08bc4f10879b1484195e80d1/AppMeasurement_Module_ActivityMap.min.js" async=""></script></