re for better drying results, reducing towel drying</li><li>Heated dry option boosts drying performance for better drying results</li></ul><strong>Ease of Use and Flexibility</strong><ul><li>Stay-put door allows you to open the door at any angle for easy loading or unloading</li><li>Delay start option lets you set the dishwasher to run on your schedule</li></ul><strong>Sanitization</strong><ul><li>NSF-Certified sanitize option removes 99.9% of common household bacteria</li></ul><strong>Energy &amp; Efficiency</strong><ul><li>ENERGY STAR certified for efficient energy use</li></ul><strong>Dimensions</strong><ul><li>Width: 60.96 cm (24")</li><li>Height: 85.09 cm (33.5")</li><li>Depth: 63.5 cm (25")</li></ul><small>This description was generated by AI and reviewed for accuracy.</small></div></div><span class="[&amp;&gt;div]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;div]:sm:pt-8"><div class="container_Xmdyu"><div class="bannersColumnWrapper_mf7qM"><div class="x-flexBanner flexBannerContainer_EyoWh"><a class="link__bbygsq sm:flex sm:w-full sm:flex-col focus-visible-outline-3" href="https://www.bestbuy.ca/en-ca/help/shipping-delivery-and-pick-up/large-item-scheduled-delivery/dishwasher-scheduled-delivery?icmp=majorapps_specialdelivery_dishwashers" target="_self" rel="external"><div class="imagePositionWrapper_bFBkH" data-automation="flex-banner-image"><div><div class="displayingImage_MlgYk"><div class="sliderTarget_HnkQY"></div><img src="https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/bltc8653f66842bff7f/blt65b17fa20b123e0b/5db32bc12dc72966da7476fa/major-apps-evergreen-pdp-appliance-help-hub-en.jpg?width=456&amp;quality=80&amp;auto=webp" srcset="https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/bltc8653f66842bff7f/blt65b17fa20b123e0b/5db32bc12dc72966da7476fa/major-apps-evergreen-pdp-appliance-help-hub-en.jpg?width=456&amp;quality=80&amp;auto=webp 1x, https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/bltc8653f66842bff7f/blt65b17fa20b123e0b/5db32bc12dc72966da7476fa/major-apps-evergreen-pdp-appliance-help-hub-en.jpg?width=912