n both performance and convenience. I would definitely recommend this dishwasher to anyone looking for a reliable and effective appliance.","id":"271404653","isVerifiedPurchaser":false,"keyConsiderations":{},"photos":[{"caption":"Nice and CLEAN! YAHOO","id":"18170044","imageUrl":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86ZnJpZ2lkYWlyZQ/e7fd0ca2-c8f5-5e78-8d7b-3f141d5373c1","thumbnailUrl":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86ZnJpZ2lkYWlyZQ/df096149-8e6a-5a8b-8ee5-ae390600d888"},{"caption":"Looks good in there!","id":"18170045","imageUrl":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86ZnJpZ2lkYWlyZQ/b4b82112-0a19-52d1-9fa2-02b1faf1c6ff","thumbnailUrl":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86ZnJpZ2lkYWlyZQ/1bbefa1f-7c09-5726-8e1c-a12b94471c92"}],"rating":5,"reviewSource":"ALL","reviewerLocation":"frigidaire.com","reviewerName":"Cruiser98z","submissionTime":"2026-08-29T00:12:12","syndicationSource":{"logoImageUrl":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg/fca31ad7-4922-4b93-93aa-886365e3ce1b","name":"frigidaire.com"},"title":"Quiet performance and spotless results!","totalNegativeFeedbackCount":0,"totalPositiveFeedbackCount":0},{"comment":"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Finally - after 10 years of just using my old dishwasher as a drying rack - there’s a shiny new one in its place!  It’s a perfect match to my other Frigidaire appliances and it actually washes and dries dishes.  There are so many different settings to choose from, but the touchpad makes it difficult to switch back and forth.  Plus, being unfamiliar with touchpad controls, the directions were hard to understand.  The black interior is quite striking, but quite dark and the door doesn’t stay open unless it’s weighted down.  Bottom line, however, is that it’s a Frigidaire which means quality at a fair price.","id":"245552093","isVerifiedPurchaser":false,"keyConsiderations":{},"photos":[{"caption":"Touchpad","id":"15275230","imageUrl":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86ZnJpZ2lkYWlyZQ/bbb8bc71-2b70-5490-9f48-d9459f9bf92a","thumbnailUrl":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86ZnJpZ2lkYWlyZQ/e1b467d3-ef64-5b69-90ee-dbe4c0d57216"},{"caption":"Interior","id":"15275231","imageUrl":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86ZnJpZ2lkYWlyZQ/6f310f82-a12a-585e-ba40-93b8ca161813","thumbnailUrl":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86ZnJpZ2lkYWlyZQ/e7c46bb8-ffc7-5dd6-911e-b50d7da3350b"}],"rating":4,"reviewSource":"ALL","reviewerLocation":"frigidaire.com","reviewerName":"BgBx3","submissionTime":"2025-10-30T17:59:57","syndicationSource":{"logoImageUrl":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg/fca31ad7-4922-4b93-93aa-886365e3ce1b","name":"frigidaire.com"},"title":"“At Last… 🎶 “","totalNegativeFeedbackCount":0,"totalPositiveFeedbackCount":0},{"comment":"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] This dishwasher is quiet and cleans so well- I don’t have to pre wash the dishes like my older model which was a whirlpool. It has so many cool settings and a delay even for me when I approach my time of use demand rate which I tried to avoid to save money on my electric bill.\r\nThis model has a trap to collect debris that can plug up \r\nThe drain and it lets everything do its correct job inside the washer! Such a beautiful design as well! Fits beautifully into my kitchen! Thank you Frigidaire for making a wonderful product! When my refrigerator goes I will look at your products first indeed! ❤️","id":"237453647","isVerifiedPurchaser":false,"keyConsiderations":{},"photos":[{"caption":"My beautiful dishwasher!!","id":"11913005","imageUrl":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86ZnJpZ2lkYWlyZQ/81fa0408-782d-59e8-9d10-6aa0b9e55d17","thumbnailUrl":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86ZnJpZ2lkYWlyZQ/f51039aa-6739-5d00-bf79-04ef638e1eff"},{"caption":"Beautiful inside and out!!","id":"11913006","i