f saving me tons of money.  I love the color of the finish inside and out.  The controls and operation is simple and complete. \r\n It's so quiet when it operates and my dishes and utensils come out clean and sanitized!  It's so nice to have a nice new Frigidaire dishwasher and it looks terrific side by side with my new Frigidaire refrigerator.  Definitely a great value.  I highly recommend going with Frigidaire!","id":"239280134","isVerifiedPurchaser":false,"keyConsiderations":{},"photos":[{"caption":"My new Frigidaire dishwasher ready to go into place","id":"12598137","imageUrl":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86ZnJpZ2lkYWlyZQ/d58813db-117b-5a8a-b27f-f308d2e91aef","thumbnailUrl":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86ZnJpZ2lkYWlyZQ/24405b4e-8989-558e-acde-dadef8bba23e"},{"caption":"My new Frigidaire dishwasher and Frigidaire refrigerator installed side by side","id":"12598138","imageUrl":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86ZnJpZ2lkYWlyZQ/68f9c2ba-318b-52c1-a6a5-600b3c3656b3","thumbnailUrl":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86ZnJpZ2lkYWlyZQ/af5a1e5f-e164-57cd-a467-4b8c22969d5c"}],"rating":5,"reviewSource":"ALL","reviewerLocation":"frigidaire.com","reviewerName":"MidCoastMainer","submissionTime":"2025-01-23T02:08:32","syndicationSource":{"logoImageUrl":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg/fca31ad7-4922-4b93-93aa-886365e3ce1b","name":"frigidaire.com"},"title":"Perfect Fit, Looks and Works Great","totalNegativeFeedbackCount":0,"totalPositiveFeedbackCount":0},{"comment":"I realize this is not totally BB’s fault however, it did take a week to get my dw.  The installer came next day & machine was faulty (panel).   BB called me & said it is Frigidaire’s policy to try to repair first.  I waited another week for a repairman & got a kid who couldn’t find the model number on the machine, couldn’t see where the power source was connected.  Zapped a good sized black spot on the metal braided hose and another small one on my floor and told me it would take 1-2 weeks for a new panel.  \n\nI think BB should have pushed Frigidaire to replace & work it out with them later.   I am recovering from surgery & still waiting for my dw.","id":"313738245","isRecommended":false,"isVerifiedPurchaser":false,"keyConsiderations":{},"photos":[],"rating":1,"reviewSource":"ALL","reviewerLocation":"Langley","reviewerName":"Unimpressed","submissionTime":"2024-07-06T01:04:05","syndicationSource":{},"title":"Not impressed","totalNegativeFeedbackCount":0,"totalPositiveFeedbackCount":2},{"comment":"We needed a new dishwasher but didn’t have hundreds to spend on something fancy. We literally went sort by lowest price to highest price on the retail website and bought the cheapest stainless steel dishwasher we could find. You could say we didn’t have great expectations. But wow, were we blown away. For the price, it’s a beautiful piece that works hard to clean your dishes. We have used it everyday at least once, twice a day when we have guests or visitors, and I’ve never had to put anything back in the machine after a wash. It’s very reliable and also surprisingly quiet! There is great value with this machine. We have no regrets and adore our Frigidaire dishwasher.","id":"234030964","isRecommended":true,"isVerifiedPurchaser":false,"keyConsiderations":{},"photos":[{"caption":"Looks great too","id":"10574397","imageUrl":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86ZnJpZ2lkYWlyZS1jYQ/ab37f9a6-dacf-5acb-9f33-9ebef0ff18c0","thumbnailUrl":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86ZnJpZ2lkYWlyZS1jYQ/96621069-c91f-50ad-97ab-2c43492e343a"}],"rating":5,"reviewSource":"ALL","reviewerLocation":"frigidaire.ca","reviewerName":"PracticalParent2921","submissionTime":"2024-06-03T22:05:43","syndicationSource":{"logoImageUrl":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg/844750f8-b6ad-49eb-a868-330028fd3240","name":"frigidaire.ca"},"title":"Great value: reliable, hardworking, and beautiful","totalNegativeFeedbackCount":0,"totalPositiveFeedbackCount":0},{"comment":"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] The best dishwasher I've owned! Simple, and extremely effective. My dishes are the cleanest they've ever been. I love the options for high heat/sanitize, and the dry cycles actually dry the dishes completely. Wonderfully priced, simple install. I would highly recommend.","id":"252883554","isVerifiedPurchaser":false,"keyConsiderations":{},"photos":[{"id":"17750075","imageUrl":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86ZnJpZ2lkYWlyZQ/c2b54dcc-1638-5862-a3d8-4eb9d498b092","thumbnailUrl":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86ZnJpZ2lkYWlyZQ/a2a34cda-3bdf-5da0-94c2-5e6e3b880640"},{"id":"17750076","imageUrl":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86ZnJpZ2lkYWlyZQ/f4cbc35b-29a0-5a64-a007-935ce5e2e4ed","thumbnailUrl":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86ZnJpZ2lkYWlyZQ/db12d76a-2b71-5c11-b17e-9f8b09e993e6"}],"rating":5,"reviewSource":"ALL","reviewerLocation":"frigidaire.com","reviewerName":"CamV27","submissionTime":"2026-07-17T11:27:35","syndicationSource":{"logoImageUrl":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg/fca31ad7-4922-4b93-93aa-886365e3ce1b","name":"frigidaire.com"},"title":" ","totalNegativeFeedbackCount":0,"totalPositiveFeedbackCount":0},{"comment":"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] The Frigidaire built-in dishwasher delivers solid performance for its price point, offering dependable cleaning power and straightforward operation. Its cycles are efficient and quiet enough for everyday use, and the interior layout typically provides flexible loading options for dishes of all sizes. While it may not have the high-end features or ultra-silent operation of premium brands, it consistently handles tough messes and dries well, making it a reliable choice for families or anyone wanting a no-nonsense, budget-friendly dishwasher. Overall, it’s a strong value appliance that performs exactly as expected without unnecessary complexity.","id":"246321021","isVerifiedPurchaser":false,"keyConsiderations":{},"photos":[],"rating":5,"reviewSource":"ALL","reviewerLocation":"frigidaire.com","reviewerName":"Jess325","submissionTime":"2025-12-03T13:34:27","syndicationSource":{"logoImageUrl":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg/fca31ad7-4922-4b93-93aa-886365e3ce1b","name":"frigidaire.com"},"title":" ","totalNegativeFeedbackCount":0,"totalPositiveFeedbackCount":0}],"currentPage":1,"pageSize":10,"totalPages":206,"totalRows":2052,"sortOption":"relevancy","filter":{},"loadingReviews":false},"customerReviewsWithPhotosOnly":{"status":"idle","sortOption":"relevancy","currentPage":0,"pageSize":10,"totalPages":0,"totalRows":0,"loadingReviews":false,"customerReviews":[],"filter":{"hasPhotos":true}},"ratingSummary":{"averageRating":4.56,"reviewCount":2094,"ratingDistribution":{"1":50,"2":26,"3":96,"4":458,"5":1464},"localeReviewCount":{"english":2052,"french":42},"recommendationCount":{"positive":491,"negative":71},"keyConsiderations":{"value":4.2222223,"quality":3.7777777,"easeOfUse":3.8888888},"sentimentSummary":"Customers overwhelmingly praise this dishwasher for exceptional cleaning performance and remarkably quiet operation. Most note dishes come out sparkling clean, handling tough residues and large items with ease, while heat dry and sanitize features deliver completely dry results. The quiet operation is frequently highlighted as a major advantage, with many noting it doesn't interrupt conversations or household activities. Reviewers appreciate the straightforward controls and sleek black interior, emphasizing strong value for the price. A very small number mention minor door design quirks, though these rarely impact satisfaction. Overall, customers consider this a highly reliable upgrade.","photoCountFirstPage":43,"hasPhotos":true}},"category":{"categoryBread