he law requires the manufacturer and the merchant to guarantee the good working order of eligible products for the number of years indicated below, starting from delivery. This warranty is free of charge.If the product malfunctions during the warranty period, you may contact the manufacturer and/or the merchant. They must repair it free of charge.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Product</th><th>Duration of legal warranty</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Stove - Refrigerator - Freezer - Air conditioner - Heat pump</td><td><strong>6 years</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Washer - Dryer - Dishwasher</td><td><strong>5 years</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Television</td><td><strong>4 years</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Laptop or desktop computer - Video game console - Cell phone - Electronic tablet</td><td><strong>3 years</strong></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>This warranty is granted automatically by the Consumer Protection Act.</strong>This Act also grants you other free warranties. These warranties allow you, among other things, to require that the product be fit for normal use for a reasonable length of time (sections 37 and 38 of the Act). They may apply during and after the end of the legal warranty of good working order.</p><p>For more information about warranties, contact the Office de la protection du consommateur at <a href=\"https://www.quebec.ca/garanties-consommateur\" target=\"_self\">Quebec.ca/garanties-consommateur.</a></p>","policyType":"eligible_consumer_protection_policy","title":"Eligible Notice of Legal Warranties","type":"policy"},{"policy":"<p>The law provides a free warranty on the product you purchase or lease: it must be fit for its normal use for a reasonable period of time.The Consumer Protection Act provides free warranties on all products you purchase or lease from a merchant.</p><p>The product must be fit:</p><ul><li>For the purpose for which it is ordinarily intended (section 37 of the Act);</li></ul><ul><li>For normal use for a reasonable period of time, which may vary depending on the price paid, the terms of the contract, and the conditions of use (section 38 of the Act).</li></ul><p>For more information about warranties, contact the Office de la protection du consommateur at <a href=\"https://www.quebec.ca/garanties-consommateur\" target=\"_self\">Québec.ca/consumer-warranties.</a></p><p> </p>","policyType":"ineligible_consumer_protection_policy","title":"Ineligible Notice Of Legal Warranties","type":"policy"}]},"gsp":{"items":[{"body":"<h3>We'll fix it or replace it.¹</h3><p>Don't get stuck with a costly repair bill if the unexpected happens to your new appliance. Best Buy Protection will take care of important repairs the manufacturer's warranty doesn't – like failure due to a power surge or issues that pop up after the warranty period ends.<br></p><h4>Discover the benefits</h4><ul><li>You'll never pay for parts and labour – we'll cover 100% of the repair costs.</li><li>If your major appliance stops working, we'll come to you for diagnosis and repair.</li><li>If your washer or dryer stops working, we'll reimburse up to $50 in laundry expenses.</li><li>If your fridge or freezer stops cooling, we'll reimburse up to $300 for spoiled food.</li><li>If your major appliance requires more than 3 repairs, we'll replace it.</li><li>If the shelf, knob, or rack doesn't fit right anymore due to normal wear and tear, we'll cover it.</li><li>If a power surge happens and your major appliance fails, we'll take care of it.</li></ul>","displayOptions":null,"title":null,"type":"text-block"},{"benefitsTitle":"<p>Get a credit for the full price you paid when our technician verifies an authorized fault. Plus, protection from power surges, and more.</p>","policy":{"policy":"<h3><strong>Future-proof your appliance.</strong><sup><strong>1</strong></sup></h3><p>Enjoy your dishwasher, worry-free.</p><table><thead><tr><th> </th><th><strong>Warranty of Good Working Order</strong></th><th><strong>Best Buy Protection</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Parts & labour</td><td>5 years</td><td>7 years</td></tr><tr><td>Get a credit for the full price you paid when our technician verifies an authorized fault</td><td>—</td><td>7 years</td></tr><tr><td>Power surge coverage</td><td>—</td><td>7 years</td></tr></tbody></table>","policyType":"regional_policy","title":"Department 52","type":"policy"},"province":"QC","type":"benefits-policy"}]},"chat":{"items":[{"enabled":false,"type":"chat-toggle"}]},"return_policy":{"items":[{"condition":"Unopened","event":{"ctaText":"Learn more about returns","eventId":null,"eventType":"help","hash":null,"query":null,"seoText":null,"url":"https://www.bestbuy.ca/en-ca/help/returns-and-exchanges/returning-or-exchanging-a-best-buy-product"},"productCategory":"Major appliances","returnDisclaimer":null,"returnExchangePeriod":"30 days","type":"return-policy"}]},"gsrp":{"items":[{"body":"<h3>Replacements made easy.¹</h3><p>Best Buy Protection Replacement Plan covers replacement costs without any deductibles or hidden fees.</p><p>If your product is found defective under normal usage, you’ll get a gift card for the original purchase price, including taxes.</p><p>You can easily request a replacement gift card anytime by <a href=\"http://BestBuy.ca/Protection\" target=\"_blank\">making a Service Request online</a>.</p>","displayOptions":null,"title":null,"type":"text-block"}]},"product_service":{"items":[{"checkboxLabel":null,"ctaText":null,"description":"<p>There are multiple professional services available for this product. You will be able to select them in checkout. </p>","icon":{"alternateText":"Professional Services Available","url":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/bltc8653f66842bff7f/bltf6add6a42689118c/69cd4d57bcfdd12c922bca80/BrandServicesIcon.svg"},"serviceBenefits":null,"shortTitle":"Professional Services Available","title":"Professional Services Available","type":"product-service"}]},"vendor_funded":{"items":[{"alternateText":"Dishwasher","bodyText":"Ready to make a